      "id": "2064987179734995242",
      "text": "Experimenting with Claude Fable 5 model by creating a Roblox minigame. \n\nIn this last session I copied a ground map of a real building from a popular real state website, connected Claude to Blender MCP, asked Claude to create a 4 floor building using that ground map and after that prepare the assets for usage in Roblox. \n\nI have no experience with 3D modeling however as an engineer I’m able to connect systems, such tasks and many more are now possible.\n\nI’m convinced AI is an enabler, not a replacement.",
